===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|s}}

# The [[branch]] of [[Islam]] that believes that the [[Qur'an]] is the [[final]] [[authority]], and that their [[leader]]s have no [[special]] [[sacred]] [[wisdom]].
# {{countable}} A [[follower]] of that [[belief]].
#: ''He is a '''Sunni'''.''

